not only is April the fifth great  because it's the first day you can walk  outside without a jacket but for Star  Trek fans its first contact day the day  of the initial meeting between humans  and Vulcans with Star Trek beyond  hitting cinemas in July director Justin  Lin took to Twitter to tease a picture  from the sets I'm Lucie and welcome to  your final frontier  GameSpot news update not only does the  image reveal new alien races but it  seems that there may be some famous  faces underneath the makeup Lin  accompanied the tweet with a blog post  that revealed that he had previously  worked with the two mysterious alien  actors he offered the prize of crew  t-shirts and posters to whoever  correctly guessed their identity II  wrote Here I am hanging with two of my  favorite people to ever work with I know  this would probably be a tough one since  the casting of these two actors hasn't  been announced yet and you won't find  them listed on IMDB so here's a hint  I've worked with them both before STB  the suggested names that followed the  post included Dwayne the rock Johnson  vin diesel Kim Colt Sung Kang and  communities Danny Pudi Star Trek beyond  is set for release on July 22nd 2016 so  who do you think is behind the mask let  me know in the comments below or come  find me on Twitter I'm at Lucy James  games for more on Star Trek and Beyond  make sure to keep in GameSpot
 

